# Summary
To create an agent with the weather tool using Qwen2.5-14B-Instruct, you can:
- Use ModelFactory.create() with model_platform=ModelPlatformType.QWEN and model_type=ModelType.QWEN_2_5_14B
- Use QwenConfig for model configuration if needed
- Use WeatherToolkit().get_tools() to get the weather tool for the agent
- Refer to examples/models/qwen_model_example.py for Qwen model usage
- Refer to examples/toolkits/post_weather_on_twitter.py for agent with weather tool usage pattern
- Use examples/agents/single_agent.py as a template for single agent script

These files provide all necessary components and usage patterns to implement the requested script.
